  "claim": "At the laboratory base M_{19}, the left and right affine coset-symmetry groups of the bilateral coset structure of Gamma^*_{M_{19}} satisfy K_L cong K_R cong 3^2:D_4. Each group has a normal regular translation subgroup C_3 x C_3 and point stabilizer D_4; both groups have order 72, exponent 12, derived series 72->18->9->1, abelianization C_2 x C_2, trivial centre, and 9 conjugacy classes. K_L != K_R as subgroups of S_9 (intersection trivial), but they are conjugate via the external structural permutation pi_0 = (1,5,3,9,6,8,7,4,2) in S_9 (lex-min of Gamma^*_{M_{19}}); pi_0 is not contained in K_L or K_R. Neither group is contained in the ambient coordinate stabilizer of the shared left-kernel direction w_left=(1,1,1,-2,-2,-2,1,1,1).",
